e": "screen01.png", "id": "686837029678994", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035354_686837033012327_5993127014333897630_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gnNEfmCsGaEQ7kNvwHoXc3E&_nc_oc=AdpNQ7497as9tjihrc1YpHnLanymcux0_5jjfStVcas75cU2aPepNBjwxqsasknWaO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWFbXvMmH1iCGh1_t-aCnu3eEI6QFMLQsKRZ5pzIOvVww&oe=6B0EF8A5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta&TAFE_Anatomy_icon_2560x1440.png", "id": "816247259438010", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001702_816247262771343_7938637194561121858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iCO9gfdGNX0Q7kNvwG0KsVT&_nc_oc=AdrXR45Qgheo9DUog-q6Z6lFdVubLfcdjkTuEpqS8OvLxCLB3ZL1p44t_-8ETFe-_Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUAzaqfA8kkkb_O5fowXIvVbklRYqxksSBh2cNmn9yFGA&oe=6B0EFD53"}, "display_name": "Animal Anatomy Explorer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo.\n\nThe experience also features an interactive quiz, which assesses the player\u2019s knowledge of the anatomy of said animal. Players are given feedback on the quiz in real-time and can learn through repetition as the questions in the quiz randomize each time it is taken. ", "short_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo."}]}, "developer_name": "TAFE NSW", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tafensw.edu.au